SUMMARY

Teaches grape to support using version tags as primary source for version information, treats version file as a generated file.

Configures GRAPE to use version tags as it's primary source for version information - runtime no longer requires vine/VERSION to be present.

Removes vine/VERSION, adds vine/VERSION to .gitignore.
